WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.644
This is Office Axe —

2
00:00:02.644 --> 00:00:08.348
one desktop app for everything an education office does with student documents.

3
00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:09.648
Let's take a tour.

4
00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:17.774
Office Axe opens like a file explorer. Browse your folders,

5
00:00:17.774 --> 00:00:22.572
switch between a list and thumbnails, sort, and search as you type.

6
00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:39.159
Select any file to see its details, and pick a light or a dark theme.

7
00:00:46.026 --> 00:00:51.397
Need a folder for every student? Paste the list of names, add numbering if you like,

8
00:00:51.397 --> 00:00:54.978
and the live preview shows exactly what will be created.

9
00:01:06.931 --> 00:01:12.517
Files preview instantly inside the app — Word documents, Excel sheets,

10
00:01:12.517 --> 00:01:16.747
photos and PDFs, with zoom — no other program needed.

11
00:01:31.411 --> 00:01:37.724
Rename with ready-made English and Korean document names. Press F2, start typing,

12
00:01:37.724 --> 00:01:39.283
and pick a template.

13
00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:43.800
You can edit the template list yourself.

14
00:01:52.418 --> 00:01:55.710
Cut and paste files between student folders.

15
00:01:55.710 --> 00:02:00.722
Every step can be undone with Control Z, and redone with Control Y.

16
00:02:09.558 --> 00:02:15.294
Convert Word documents to PDF in the background, and the originals are always kept.

17
00:02:20.663 --> 00:02:26.999
Combine phone photos of pages into one PDF, or turn PDF pages into images.

18
00:02:42.126 --> 00:02:46.174
Compress big scans to a target size, like one megabyte.

19
00:02:46.174 --> 00:02:51.030
Office Axe estimates the result for each setting before you start.

20
00:03:02.781 --> 00:03:05.589
Merge documents into one PDF.

21
00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:18.826
Split a long file every few pages, or click the pages you want to extract.

22
00:03:41.907 --> 00:03:47.544
Arrange pages visually. Delete a blank page — Control Z brings it back —

23
00:03:47.544 --> 00:03:51.459
rotate a sideways scan, and drag pages into order.

24
00:04:06.672 --> 00:04:10.032
The PDF editor fills in real form fields.

25
00:04:28.739 --> 00:04:31.849
Draw your signature and drop it on the line.

26
00:04:31.849 --> 00:04:36.443
Fit a passport photo into the photo box, then save a signed copy.

27
00:05:04.786 --> 00:05:09.442
Mark up scans and photos with highlights, boxes and arrows.

28
00:05:30.841 --> 00:05:34.866
Make passport and visa photos at the exact size — here,

29
00:05:34.866 --> 00:05:39.111
thirty-five by forty-five millimetres — with a face guide,

30
00:05:39.111 --> 00:05:42.625
a file-size limit and a four-by-six print sheet.

31
00:05:50.486 --> 00:05:53.831
Need a formal photo? With your own OpenAI key,

32
00:05:53.831 --> 00:05:57.904
the AI tool dresses a casual portrait in a suit and tie.

33
00:05:57.904 --> 00:06:00.086
Then compare before and after.

34
00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:24.784
Click QR, then click any QR code on your screen. Links open in your browser,

35
00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:26.872
and text is shown right away.

36
00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:41.904
Zip files with a password, or lock a PDF so it needs a password to open.

37
00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:11.162
There's a built-in screen recorder, and you can grab a screenshot of any region.

38
00:07:27.956 --> 00:07:33.007
Your plan, devices and payment history live on the Subscription page,

39
00:07:33.007 --> 00:07:36.668
and Settings keeps your folders, theme and AI key.

40
00:07:52.357 --> 00:07:55.837
Office Axe. Student documents, sorted.
